---
layout: base.njk
title: Speakers
description: Confirmed speakers at Airspace World 2026 — the ANSP executives, regulators, technologists, and operators on the ASW 2026 stage.
permalink: /speakers/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Speakers</p>
    <h1>The ASW 2026 stage</h1>
    <p>Speaker confirmations are added here as CANSO publishes them. The list is refreshed against the official programme.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    {% if collections.speakers.length %}
      <div class="list-grid">
        {% for speaker in collections.speakers %}
          <a class="list-card" href="{{ speaker.url }}">
            <p class="list-card-meta">{{ speaker.data.organisation or "Speaker" }}</p>
            <h3>{{ speaker.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ speaker.data.role }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p>Speaker confirmations open soon. Subscribe on the homepage to be notified as new speakers are added.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
